      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb54f624edee1109aa859e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用happy的歌，\r\n传达happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721f57f4ecaa82e4418766a97a72b7b74a8ba26a17b023df52fdee722ba1548a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bd3777d623da6dd0c6e755b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大地之「声」与我的歌声！\r\n能够驱散所有灾厄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcedb9c6fcfd8d4c5376dd34a8a139a7aa35fbc00d5ac9f2095d4935f31fe3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a112220fca2bca47be96304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你、我和风水！\r\n来带给大家Rickey☆Happy☆吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56cfd1b6048b7b1f78b7a4e44c1e9edaae6502ed024a32e40f8bc2ebb6546739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88bac1dc2823b90adf17508b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你与我是「相生」的关系！\r\n以后也要互相切磋成长喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9820623e601a8da6bddb5b0443f825331f184e53e6c06832b94f9bcb97e48189",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eace05bf2afb15895b815f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫色的制服──能让老师和学生、\r\n前辈和后辈，都建立良好的关系喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a15a6d2e6e9895a7dee221869e09eeaedee7ee1358be686b10aeb6176f0e2a43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1870727828b92cc1ec7222c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风会带来缘分──希望能用这件\r\n轻飘飘的衣服，办场快乐的演唱会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e5faa392e7d322d180a32b91b1fb51771dff6069ed4ac11b965acdeb687bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5dbe6c43cfb46ce75dcb20a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "五行、阴阳、八卦──我要将力量\r\n集中到决胜服，拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5de2ca43195aacaeb4d39bb3a0ccb05622a71b252639c22f8152d0ef68e13c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0ded5ca8bd7c745540eabbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会穿很久的衣服，必须好好保养。\r\n洁净整齐的衣服能招来lucky喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f540dd4dd8cc025103f27658853a332b08bbb2c5a57d34f247c9bbb7a5b2fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79b25a5b18c7e5b059a0271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能替比赛和演唱会\r\n带来福气的服装真的很棒呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12043d8268d549e3766676b1ed4a4ac38efe79ce5cabe60dc4180826aaa115c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbe91a68bbef0360b5e73624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的颜色和设计都很抢眼吧♪\r\n这样大家就会关注我happy的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca92f68c21c74a74f73de7c69b2d495cd8a50f9d2541a4b1b430c7fb767dcc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be796c5126ecfd752021cafe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟要奏响幸运，\n得华丽一点才行呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "73491857519553c6a8f57b9189933aaf0f7f03d8e17775625c51a0de5081528c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf920e38ba0ac759247260b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运势的节拍？就交给我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a7cd9ddb4cb40bac1f58de5af1e0ff1e2071437d366142ea6b580e9372e93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7fe0ded1c6e54235bd17a70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Rickey☆Lucky☆\r\n换衣服啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b198fcadad29711f62c215cbbb0bc1af0edb130140d6426ef2ac899ba3666518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61175a54526d40a1fe32c5c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑选服装的秘诀？\r\n嗯……应该会看想实现什么目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c3095f243be48ae52bad0dbfa16082d5df1faf305930dcbbd50212bc905b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79fca27d1c6f485adb58d030",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就运气满满了！\n休息日也不能忘了给自己注入生气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc7f0ca45515573a8ad05d065bfb87342fc99a2b98713ba49b233a69d62d904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d472e8bbb1039cd377d3fe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一穿就心情明朗，\n喜欢到不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "330850fecff3a5fcb00ba44d1a8ddbdf47194096aec2e5c14788f7c7c3f58c95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1098",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf09a93d5afba25865c69faf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会穿很久的衣服，必须好好保养。\r\n洁净整齐的衣服能招来lucky喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f540dd4dd8cc025103f27658853a332b08bbb2c5a57d34f247c9bbb7a5b2fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
